From b9555e7b4f59cdf05ccdd1971a7a143e88ab9945 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 14:01:19 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(skills): address CodeRabbit review on #292

- dev eval: reword the "build out the task list from the design doc" case (plan
  framing) to unambiguous dev work ("implement the already-planned tasks, TDD each")
  so the dev router doesn't accept a planning request.
- verify: scope the merged-PR lookup to the current HEAD SHA
  (`--search "$(git rev-parse HEAD)"`) instead of `--limit 1` newest, so cleanup
  and issue closure attach to the right change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .codex/skills/dev/evals/evals.json | 2 +-
 .codex/skills/verify/SKILL.md      | 5 +++--
 skills/dev/evals/evals.json        | 2 +-
 skills/verify/SKILL.md             | 5 +++--
 4 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.codex/skills/dev/evals/evals.json b/.codex/skills/dev/evals/evals.json
index 416391f0..12fd33fe 100644
--- a/.codex/skills/dev/evals/evals.json
+++ b/.codex/skills/dev/evals/evals.json
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@
     "should_trigger": true
   },
   {
-    "query": "Build out the task list from the design doc using red-green-refactor",
+    "query": "Implement the already-planned tasks one at a time, red-green-refactor each",
     "should_trigger": true
   },
   {
diff --git a/.codex/skills/verify/SKILL.md b/.codex/skills/verify/SKILL.md
index 3194ca0a..72945683 100644
--- a/.codex/skills/verify/SKILL.md
+++ b/.codex/skills/verify/SKILL.md
@@ -41,10 +41,11 @@ Confirm the merge actually landed on master. If the PR isn't merged yet, stop an
 
 ### Step 2: Confirm PR Is Merged
 
-Detect the most recently merged PR from the current HEAD commit:
+Detect the PR that produced the current HEAD commit — scope the lookup to that
+commit's SHA so you don't pick up an unrelated newer merge:
 
 ```bash
-gh pr list --state merged --base master --limit 1 --json number,state,mergedAt,mergedBy
+gh pr list --state merged --base master --search "$(git rev-parse HEAD)" --limit 1 --json number,state,mergedAt,mergedBy
 ```
 
 - `state` should be `MERGED`
